ure?  Or?<br><br><strong>7. Test driver's license </strong><br>Want to drive a better car? It has to be an old driver.<br><i> Right, pay attention to the car on the road. </i><br><br><strong>8. Seeding</strong><br>Buy your own field, then -&gt;<br>Create wealth and cultivate life.<br>(Working, it\u2019s good to do it for two days a month.....)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079480/extras/f4f6d1758a3586103c9192c906caa3e6.avif?t=1561445909\" width=500 height=262 /></span><br><br><strong>9. Be an internet addiction teenager? </strong><br>I still stay at home online today, work or something, tired...<br>I can see a day at a small break (\u0e51\u2022\u0300\u1107\u2022\u0301)\u0648\u2727<br>However, remember to pay the network fee.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note</h2>1. The game will <strong> keep updating </strong>, add interesting things;<br>2. Welcome to feedback ideas, suggestions, bugs in the comments. If your message is accepted, it will give you a Dabaobei (small gift);<br>3. The game is in the process of continuous improvement and development. If you have troubles in the game, please be considerate.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1079480/extras/3b45868f340c9f09fcc32600e5bd1542.avif?t=1561445909\" width=536 height=401 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"f8c04c3a67ce061ed41dc4573dc48f5f66bde030.jpg","localized_name":"\u94f6\u795e","name":"\u94f6\u795e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1079480/f8c04c3a67ce061ed41dc4573dc48f5f66bde030.jpg"},{"icon":"775a1075d1067b3c8397b4210de01b767becb7c1.jpg","localized_name":"\u51b2\u795e","name":"\u51b2\u795e","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1079480/775a1075d1067b3c8397b4210de01b767becb7c1.jpg"},{"icon":"1edea6d53a7207ac63bad0f0b9874318cd13271f.jpg"